      "latin": "Fa ammā man ṡaqulat mawāzīnuh(ū).",
      "translation_id": "Siapa yang berat timbangan (kebaikan)-nya,",
      "translation_en": "Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds],",
      "audio": {
        "01": "https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdullah-Al-Juhany/101006.mp3",
